{"asset_key":"ep6/quest_story_16108050","episode":"ep6","category":"quest_story","story_id":"16108050","schema_version":1,"lang":"kr","texts":{"say:1:1610805001:1":{"text":"점점 더 떨려... 손에 막 땀도 나고, 심장도 막 쿵쾅쿵쾅거리고... 나 어떡해...","source_cn":"我……越临近考试我越觉得紧张，现在我的手出了好多汗，心...","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x8565286D9F699C49","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"choice_prompt:2:1610805001":{"text":"점점 더 떨려... 손에 막 땀도 나고, 심장도 막 쿵쾅쿵쾅거리고... 나 어떡해...","source_cn":"我……越临近考试我越觉得紧张，现在我的手出了好多汗，心也在怦怦跳！","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x8565286D9F699C49","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:3:1610805002:0":{"text":"피파, 진정하고 심호흡 크게 한 번 하면서 마음을 조금 가라앉혀 봐. 긴장하다가 실수하면 너무 아깝잖아.","source_cn":"皮帕，你别慌，深呼吸一下平复心情。要是因为紧张害怕而失...","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xC4E6C5A8DAE6A828","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:4:1610805003:0":{"text":"자꾸 그날 교장 선생님께서 쓰러지셨던 모습이 떠올라...","source_cn":"我、我脑子里总想着那天校长一下子倒在地上的情景。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x6E61043ABFAC7277","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:5:1610805004:0":{"text":"그리고 심문소에서 조사를 받았던 때도... 이브 특사님이 친절하게 대해주셨는데, 그래도 너무 무서웠어...","source_cn":"还有审查所的审讯……虽然伊芙特使态度很好，可我就是不由...","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x5E9AD6A5476C95F8","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:6:1610805005:1":{"text":"이해해... 교장 선생님께서 쓰러지셨을 때 나도 바로 옆에 있었으니까.","source_cn":"我理解……校长倒下的时候，我就在他身边。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x11756E5AB8460C56","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:7:1610805006:1":{"text":"다 괜찮을 거야. 조사는 끝났고 교장 선생님께서 돌아가신 건 우리와 관련 없다는 결론도 났잖아. 그러니까 진정하고 그 일은 그만 생각하자. ","source_cn":"好了，休，皮帕，没事了。伊芙特使不是已经调查清楚了吗，...","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x21AC95074C5D104B","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:8:1610805007:1":{"text":"그냥 오늘 선발 시험만 생각하자.","source_cn":"与其一直沉浸在恐慌里，不如想想今天的选拔赛。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x564CA3414D2D3E03","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:9:1610805008:1":{"text":"오늘이 예선 마지막 관문이고, 이번 시험을 통과해야 결승에 올라갈 수 있으니까 집중해야 해.","source_cn":"今天可是初赛的最后关卡了，只要通过就能晋级决赛，你们可...","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x7ABB1968833AB843","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:10:1610805009:1":{"text":"아 맞다. 오늘 선발 시험에는 변신술이 필요하다던데?","source_cn":"对了，我听说今天的选拔赛要用到变形术！","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x18ABABF765A8DA28","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:12:1610805010:1":{"text":"변신술? 궁정 마법사가 이제 변신도 해야 해?","source_cn":"变形术？宫廷魔法师需要变形？","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xEED090DB3D4ED758","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:14:1610805011:1":{"text":"저기, 얘들아... 방해해서 미안한데... 심사 위원이 곧 도착하신다고 다들 모이래.","source_cn":"各位，不好意思，打断一下……今天比赛的评委马上就要来了...","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xC7EB417D7A91FAC3","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"choice:2:0:1":{"text":"나도 그래","source_cn":"我也很紧张","status":"matched_runtime_gender","hash_xxh64":"0x43F088E7211FD9F6","variant_status":"runtime_gender_keys_target_same","male":"나도 그래","female":"나도 그래","variant_male_record_index":"81797","variant_female_record_index":"81798","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"choice:2:1:2":{"text":"나는 오히려 차분한데","source_cn":"我倒是感觉很平静","status":"matched_runtime_gender","hash_xxh64":"0x225AC8FF2086E316","variant_status":"runtime_gender_keys_target_same","male":"나는 오히려 차분한데","female":"나는 오히려 차분한데","variant_male_record_index":"81799","variant_female_record_index":"81800","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""}},"speakers":{"speaker:皮帕":{"text":"피파","source":"皮帕","status":"matched_dialogue_flow"},"speaker:格墨文":{"text":"그로웬","source":"格墨文","status":"matched_dialogue_flow"},"speaker:休":{"text":"실벤","source":"休","status":"matched_dialogue_flow"},